{"availability":"available","full":"RCushmaniii/react-vite-tailwind-base","name":"react-vite-tailwind-base","description":"React 19 template with ShadCN UI, TypeScript, and Vite 7. Features a fully interactive appointment booking system with calendar integration, real-time data visualizations using Recharts, and 17+ accessible components. Mobile-first design, SEO optimized, and built with modern best practices. Perfect for SaaS apps, dashboards, and booking systems.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":2,"forks":1,"created":"2025-10-02T22:40:01Z","updated":"2026-10-09T14:39:22Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://react-vite-tailwind-base.vercel.app","topics":["react","shadcn","shadcn-ui","tailwindcss","vite"],"demo":"https://react-vite-tailwind-base.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T02:46:37.484Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T02:46:37.484Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T02:46:37.484Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T15:39:42.738Z","stars":2,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-13T02:09:36.605Z","stars":2,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-19T02:46:37.484Z","stars":2,"forks":1}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A production-ready React template with ShadCN UI, data visualizations, and a complete interactive appointment booking showcase.","React Vite Tailwind Base is a modern starter template that ships with working features instead of empty scaffolding. It includes 17+ ShadCN UI components, an interactive appointment booking system, a data visualization dashboard with three chart types, and a documentation viewer — all wired up with real state management and responsive design.","The template eliminates the hours of boilerplate configuration that come with starting a new React project. TypeScript strict mode, ESLint, Prettier, path aliases, Tailwind theming, component libraries, routing, and API mocking are all pre-configured and ready to extend."],"features":[],"sourceUrl